{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_002_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:56b562a3b3f5649620f457db7e950ba77371adf97144c11282cc2792d55d2b4b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70924e9e984d19b8b3677ef698b4069bbec95fb73ef416fe852c5b0d13771a3b",
      "text": "哇啊～！\n这是什么，好厉害～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a93c846ba432fe962ab2494de8f483e09bc01131f9fa43dd30657885653bb80",
      "text": "怎么样，吃惊了吧。想吃多少吃多少。\n专门给翔太准备的“满汉全席”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff3f39628d9132ff0900b5c4b7a2b2ed65730ac1e46aa7fb5984c5f0e2765771",
      "text": "满汉全席？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61e01f10f11735e1d7bcd9a776658e438b6cf02f10cec5b6081c699bfb9e82a6",
      "text": "意思就是把所有美味的东西都搜罗过来的派对啦。\n嘛，虽说只是仿照的罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f1bb165734958ba4325e6be07aa1cebb1f10bea34c6a2d51a22c95178be8943",
      "text": "冬马亲手做的料理、我订购的单点菜肴，\n还有制作人准备的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14ec44c986c80cfd14c7427b67ec050b1be85928ceb9467a5017d041404c1d27",
      "text": "桌上从这头到那头，全都是自助无限畅吃的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b528a389f36939dc66dec7ce5e9fdeed296becb3d5ebb3102a2b9587158d859",
      "text": "不仅是中华料理，日式西式应有尽有，\n总之把你喜欢吃的东西全塞进去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea9429841cc823bdbadb3c4df8e9b40200daaee9457b70384551854dd0ba9148",
      "text": "重新看一遍也觉得分量真惊人呢。\n借用事务所的厨房很早就开始准备了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d5031423b3803925f4cca23cf5acbb458beaea15de61120975b730b7c07ebcd",
      "text": "真不愧是你们。两个人果然最懂我了～\n那么，我可就不客气地开动啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_d:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b29fd0b0858f9b1c647c54c950bd46c25b7c25ac7daab9bf3931c83d7ebbdd1b",
      "text": "……唔～我真是太幸福了♪\n谢谢你们，冬马君、北斗君。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
